BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wellness Collective Moab": "https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wellness_collective
URL:https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar
SUMMARY:Community Ear Acupuncture & Sound Bath
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T183000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T193000
UID:4418a447f82a44af0f11ecea8146fafe@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Through partnership with Recovery Center: Join us for a tranqu
 il evening of community Ear Acupuncture featuring the NADA Protocol—a tr
 eatment known for supporting recovery and overall wellness. 🌱 Why try E
 ar Acupuncture? It’s excellent for: ✔ Reducing cravings ✔ Easing wit
 hdrawal symptoms ✔ Lowering stress and anxiety ✔ Promoting emotional b
 alance during the session\, relax on a yoga mat and let the soothing sound
 s transport you to a state of deep relaxation and mindfulness. 🎶 This c
 lass is perfect for anyone on a recovery journey or looking to enjoy some 
 peaceful introspection in a supportive community setting. Your donation he
 lps us keep these essential wellness services accessible to all. ✨ Reser
 ve your spot and start your journey towards healing and inner peace. ✨
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wellness Collective Moab": "https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wellness_collective
URL:https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar
SUMMARY:Flow into Friday Yoga with bre
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260417T083000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260417T093000
UID:944fed7a1e5f8330b50b808099f82d95@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:A gentle and grounding way to move mindfully into your weekend
 . Start your Friday with this all-levels yoga class designed to help you a
 waken the body\, center the mind\, and ease into your day with intention. 
 We’ll begin with slow\, fluid movement to energize and open\, followed b
 y longer-held stretches and restorative postures to help you release tensi
 on and reconnect with yourself. This class is inclusive\, beginner-friendl
 y\, and rooted in breath\, balance\, and compassionate movement. Whether y
 ou’re unwinding from your week or preparing for the weekend ahead\, Frid
 ay Flow is a chance to show up just as you are.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
